<resources>
    <!--
      Spanish. Machine translation, reviewed for consistency of terminology.

      Left in English on purpose: "System", "Secure" and "Global" name Android's three
      settings tables, and a translated label would no longer match what the platform, its
      documentation or any adb command calls them. Shizuku is a product name.

      Terminology follows Android's own Spanish: "Ajustes", "opciones de desarrollador",
      "servicios de accesibilidad", "depuración USB", "acceso directo". "Revertir" is the
      one verb used for revert everywhere in the app.
    -->
